This file should be a proper ICO file. Please replace this with a real favicon.ico file.

To create proper PWA icons:

1. Create a 512x512 PNG icon with your app logo
2. Use an online tool like https://realfavicongenerator.net/ or https://favicon.io/
3. Generate all required sizes:
   - favicon.ico (16x16, 32x32)
   - icon-192.png (192x192)
   - icon-512.png (512x512)
   - apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)

For now, you can use a simple colored square as placeholder.